Traccar
-------

Traccar (https://github.com/traccar/traccar)
Copyright Anton Tananaev and Traccar contributors
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No Traccar source code is included. The simulators build the frames that
the trackers module's tests take from Traccar's protocol decoder tests
(see the trackers NOTICE), and some demo identities are values from
those tests: the terminal ID 866496077582164 (jt808sim), the IMEI
359586015829802 (tk103sim test) and the IMEI 861693034634154 (examples
and cmd/trackersim documentation). They are used as protocol facts and
demo values.

