Manufacturers' documents
------------------------

The frames follow the manufacturers' published protocol documents named
in PROVENANCE.md (Concox, Teltonika, Coban, Queclink, Meitrack, Ruptela,
Jimi IoT, HuaSunTeK, Cantrack) and, for ais140sim, the field layouts of
AIS-140 and its amendments (ARAI). The layouts are protocol facts; no
text of these documents is reproduced.

Test data
---------

Every IMEI, ICCID, phone number, password, address, position and device
ID in this module is a demo value. Apart from the Traccar values above,
they are made up; none is taken from the AIS-140 standard's samples.

